<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan nickel imports up 22.3 pct yr/yr--MOF.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan nickel imports up 22.3 pct yr/yr--MOF.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's refined nickel imports rose 22.3 percent to 6,795 tonnes in January from 5,557 tonnes in the same month a year earlier, Finance Ministry data released on Friday showed.</p>
<p>Details were as follows (on a customs-cleared basis, in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   Jan 96	 Dec 96	Jan 95</p>
<p> Total	   6,795	  3,278	 5,557</p>
<p>Major suppliers:</p>
<p> Russia	  1,206	    814	 1,234</p>
<p> S. Africa	 978	     20	   649</p>
<p> Zimbabwe	1,118	    197	   763</p>
<p>Imports in 1996 totalled 53,852 tonnes, down 23.2 percent from 70,128 tonnes in the previous year.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Commodities Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
